2-3\" data-name=\"short card article\">\n<img alt=\"Sunlight tracing a curved concrete staircase — Aleksandr Zaitsev on Unsplash\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"short thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1743760676341-ac13322116ad?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=420&amp;h=747&amp;q=80\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#080609] via-transparent to-[#040407]/15\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"short thumbnail gradient overlay\"></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Play A slower ascent\" class=\"glass absolute top-3 right-3 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"short play overlay button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"play triangle icon\"></i></button>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"short caption block\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"short title\">A slower ascent</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] text-[#e0d6c9]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"short genre and duration\">Architecture · 0:28</p></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"posts-title\" class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"featured posts section\">\n<div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"posts section header\"><h2 class=\"text-[21px] font-semibold tracking-[-.4px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"posts section title\" id=\"posts-title\">Featured Posts</h2><button aria-label=\"View all posts\" class=\"text-[18px] text-[#c8c3b7]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"view all posts link\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow up-right icon\"></i></button></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"posts grid\">\n<article class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"post card article\">\n<div class=\"photo-surface relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"post image container\">\n<img alt=\"A photographic study of black sand and sea — Jan Canty on Unsplash\" class=\"size-full object-cover object-[65%_center]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"post image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1790283124162-338b2f8e9171?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=480&amp;h=600&amp;q=80\"/>\n<button aria-label=\"Like Notes from the coast\" class=\"glass absolute right-3 bottom-3 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"post like button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-heart\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"heart icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"post title\">Notes from the coast</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#c6c0b6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"post description\">The tide leaves a different line every time.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-[#a9a49d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"post date and type label\">24 October · Photo essay</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"post card article\">\n<div class=\"photo-surface relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"post image container\">\n<img alt=\"Amber architectural glass catching the light — 金西 卢 on Unsplash\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"post image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1683799286400-69220fa89f48?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=480&amp;h=600&amp;q=80\"/>\n<button aria-label=\"Like Light held in glass\" class=\"glass absolute right-3 bottom-3 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"post like button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-heart\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"heart icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"post title\">Light held in glass</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#c6c0b6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"post description\">The colours behind the sound of Afterglow.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-[#a9a49d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"post date and type label\">22 October · Studio notes</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"mt-9 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 pb-8 text-[13px] text-[#cec7b8]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"footer bar\">\n<p data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">YT Media • Powered by Vorex Agency | Built by Dhiraj Kondalwar</p>\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#b4ae9f]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"footer tagline block\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"headphone icon holder\"><i class=\"icon-headphones\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"headphones icon\"></i></span>Make yourself at home.</span>\n</footer>\n<section aria-label=\"Persistent music player — Afterglow, paused\" class=\"glass relative flex min-h-[124px] items-center gap-5 rounded-full px-6 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"persistent music player bar\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-20 top-0 h-px bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#d4af3770,#06b6d440,transparent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"player top accent line\"></div>\n<div class=\"flex w-[265px] shrink-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"player album block\">\n<div class=\"vinyl relative flex size-[86px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"vinyl record graphic\">\n<img alt=\"Afterglow record label, amber glass photograph — 金西 卢 on Unsplash\" class=\"size-[38px] rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vinyl record label image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1683799286400-69220fa89f48?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=120&amp;h=120&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 size-1.5 -translate-1/2 rounded-full border border-[#dabd75] bg-[#111014]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"vinyl spindle hole dot\"></span>\n<span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[conic-gradient(from_20deg,transparent_15%,#ffffff15_24%,transparent_35%,transparent_65%,#ffffff10_74%,transparent_85%)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"vinyl sheen effect overlay\"></span>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"player track info block\"><h2 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#f0dfae]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"now playing track title\">Afterglow</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-[#c9c2b2]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"now playing track genre\">Ambient · Amber studies</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#ccc5b7]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"now playing playback state\">Paused</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"player playback controls group\">\n<button aria-label=\"Shuffle off\" class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center text-[#aaa59a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"shuffle toggle button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-shuffle\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shuffle icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Previous track\" class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"previous track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-skip-back\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"skip back icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Play Afterglow\" class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#e1cc91] text-[21px] text-[#1d190f]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-3\" data-name=\"main play/pause button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play ml-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-3-1\" data-name=\"play triangle icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Next track\" class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-4\" data-name=\"next track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-skip-forward\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-4-1\" data-name=\"skip forward icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Repeat off\" class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center text-[#aaa59a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-5\" data-name=\"repeat toggle button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-repeat\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-3-5-1\" data-name=\"repeat icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-[170px] flex-1 px-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4\" data-name=\"player progress section\">\n<svg aria-label=\"Audio waveform, paused at 1 minute 42 seconds of 4 minutes 32 seconds\" class=\"h-[39px] w-full\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-1\" data-name=\"audio waveform visualization\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 320 42\">\n<defs><path d=\"M2 18v6 M7 14v14 M12 10v22 M17 15v12 M22 6v30 M27 2v38 M32 9v24 M37 14v14 M42 7v28 M47 12v18 M52 16v10 M57 8v26 M62 4v34 M67 11v20 M72 15v12 M77 7v28 M82 12v18 M87 3v36 M92 6v30 M97 13v16 M102 9v24 M107 15v12 M112 17v8 M117 12v18 M122 8v26 M127 5v32 M132 10v22 M137 16v10 M142 13v16 M147 7v28 M152 11v20 M157 15v12 M162 3v36 M167 6v30 M172 12v18 M177 16v10 M182 9v24 M187 5v32 M192 12v18 M197 15v12 M202 8v26 M207 3v36 M212 10v22 M217 14v14 M222 7v28 M227 12v18 M232 17v8 M237 11v20 M242 6v30 M247 9v24 M252 15v12 M257 12v18 M262 4v34 M267 8v26 M272 14v14 M277 10v22 M282 6v30 M287 12v18 M292 15v12 M297 9v24 M302 14v14 M307 17v8 M312 15v12 M317 18v6\" id=\"audio-wave\"></path><clippath id=\"played-wave\"><rect height=\"42\" width=\"120\"></rect></clippath></defs>\n<use href=\"#audio-wave\" stroke=\"#777164\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></use>\n<use clip-path=\"url(#played-wave)\" href=\"#audio-wave\" stroke=\"#ddc57e\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></use>\n</svg>\n<label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-2\" data-name=\"seek bar accessible label\" for=\"seek\">Seek position</label><input aria-valuetext=\"1 minute 42 seconds of 4 minutes 32 seconds\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-3\" data-name=\"seek position slider\" id=\"seek\" max=\"272\" min=\"0\" type=\"range\" value=\"102\"/>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-between text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#e0d7c2]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-4\" data-name=\"progress time display\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-4-1\" data-name=\"elapsed time value\">1:42</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-4-2\" data-name=\"total duration value\">4:32</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex w-[115px] shrink-0 items-center gap-3 pl-2 text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-5\" data-name=\"player volume control group\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-volume-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-5-1\" data-name=\"volume icon\"></i><label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-5-2\" data-name=\"volume accessible label\" for=\"volume\">Volume</label><input aria-valuetext=\"65 percent\" class=\"w-[70px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-5-3\" data-name=\"volume slider\" id=\"volume\" max=\"100\" min=\"0\" type=\"range\" value=\"65\"/></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Open music queue\" class=\"flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[21px] text-[#cfc7b6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-6\" data-name=\"open music queue button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-list-music\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-6-1\" data-name=\"music list icon\"></i></button>\n</section>\n</main>\n</div>\n</div>",
