tle\" class=\"mt-6 pb-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"quick-play music section\">\n<div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"music section header row\"><h2 class=\"yt-display text-[30px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"music section title\" id=\"music-title\">Quick-Play Music Tracks</h2><button class=\"yt-room-link flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-[#bcb6a9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"view all music link button\" type=\"button\">View all Music<i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow up-right icon\"></i></button></div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"music tracks grid\">\n<article class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"music track card 1\">\n<div class=\"yt-glass yt-media relative size-[132px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"track cover art container\"><img alt=\"Cyan and amber night lights rippling on water, Night currents cover — Negative Space on Pexels\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"cover art photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/34635/pexels-photo.jpg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=360&amp;q=80\"/><button aria-label=\"Play Night currents\" class=\"yt-control absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f5f3ea] text-[16px] text-[#111114]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"play track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"play icon\"></i></button></div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"track 1 title group\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"track title\">Night currents</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#b0aaa4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"track genre and duration\">Ambient · 4:32</p><span class=\"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] text-[#ddc982]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"in-deck status badge\"><i class=\"icon-disc-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"vinyl disc icon\"></i>In the deck</span></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"music track card 2\">\n<div class=\"yt-glass yt-media relative size-[132px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"track cover art container\"><img alt=\"Warm amber reflections on dark water, Afterglow cover — Mathias Reding on Pexels\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cover art photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/10410211/pexels-photo-10410211.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=360&amp;q=80\"/><button aria-label=\"Play Afterglow\" class=\"yt-control absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/90 text-[16px] text-[#111114]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"play track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"play icon\"></i></button></div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"track 2 title group\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"track title\">Afterglow</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#b0aaa4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"track genre and duration\">Electronic · 3:48</p></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3\" data-name=\"music track card 3\">\n<div class=\"yt-glass yt-media relative size-[132px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"track cover art container\"><img alt=\"A quiet waterfall in a dark green gorge, Still water cover — V on Unsplash\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"cover art photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1761432755951-b0a276558264?auto=format&amp;w=360&amp;q=80&amp;fit=crop\"/><button aria-label=\"Play Still water\" class=\"yt-control absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/90 text-[16px] text-[#111114]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"play track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"play icon\"></i></button></div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"track 3 title group\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"track title\">Still water</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#b0aaa4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"track genre and duration\">Soundscape · 5:16</p></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"mb-4 mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[#958061]/25 py-6 text-[13px] text-[#a69f93]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"home pane footer\"><p data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\"><span class=\"text-[#d8cba6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">YT Media</span> • Powered by Vorex Agency | Built by Dhiraj Kondalwar</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[17px] text-[#b39b5f]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"footer orbit logo icon wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-orbit\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"orbit logo icon\"></i></span></footer>\n</main>\n<section aria-label=\"Persistent vinyl music deck, Night currents, paused\" class=\"yt-glass relative col-span-2 flex items-center gap-7 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"persistent music player deck\">\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-10 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-[#ff0033]/40 via-[#d4af37]/70 to-[#06b6d4]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"decorative top accent gradient line\"></div>\n<div class=\"flex w-[295px] shrink-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"current track info group\">\n<div class=\"yt-vinyl relative flex size-[72px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"spinning vinyl record disc\"><img alt=\"Night currents vinyl label, water reflections — Negative Space on Pexels\" class=\"size-9 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vinyl label photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/34635/pexels-photo.jpg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=120&amp;q=80\"/><span class=\"absolute size-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#b6ad94] bg-[#111114]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"vinyl center spindle dot\"></span></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"current track title group\"><h2 class=\"text-[16px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"current track name\">Night currents</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#b4ada0]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"current track status\">Ambient · Paused</p></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Save Night currents\" class=\"yt-control ml-auto flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[18px] text-[#bdb6a9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"save current track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-heart\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"heart icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"transport controls group\">\n<button aria-label=\"Shuffle\" class=\"yt-control flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[17px] text-[#9d978b]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"shuffle button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-shuffle\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shuffle icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Previous track\" class=\"yt-control flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"previous track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-skip-back\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"skip back icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Play Night currents\" class=\"yt-control flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#e3d7b5] text-[23px] text-[#19170f] hover:bg-[#f1e4bf]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-3\" data-name=\"play/pause primary button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-3-1\" data-name=\"play icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Next track\" class=\"yt-control flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-4\" data-name=\"next track button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-skip-forward\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-4-1\" data-name=\"skip forward icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Repeat\" class=\"yt-control flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[17px] text-[#9d978b]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-5\" data-name=\"repeat button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-repeat-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-3-5-1\" data-name=\"repeat icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Track position 1 minute 24 seconds of 4 minutes 32 seconds\" class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"track position and seek bar\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] tabular-nums text-[#bfb7a7]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"current time display\">1:24</span>\n<div aria-label=\"Track seek\" aria-valuemax=\"272\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuenow=\"84\" class=\"relative flex h-10 min-w-0 flex-1 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"track seek slider waveform\" role=\"slider\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-9 w-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"track waveform SVG visualization\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 420 40\"><defs><lineargradient id=\"deck-wave\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#d4af37\"></stop><stop offset=\".31\" stop-color=\"#d4af37\"></stop><stop offset=\".315\" stop-color=\"#6c6355\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#6c6355\"></stop></lineargradient></defs><path d=\"M2 17v6 M8 13v14 M14 9v22 M20 15v10 M26 6v28 M32 11v18 M38 4v32 M44 12v16 M50 16v8 M56 10v20 M62 5v30 M68 2v36 M74 8v24 M80 12v16 M86 6v28 M92 14v12 M98 10v20 M104 4v32 M110 8v24 M116 14v12 M122 6v28 M128 10v20 M134 4v32 M140 11v18 M146 16v8 M152 12v16 M158 5v30 M164 9v22 M170 13v14 M176 6v28 M182 3v34 M188 11v18 M194 15v10 M200 10v20 M206 6v28 M212 12v16 M218 4v32 M224 8v24 M230 14v12 M236 10v20 M242 5v30 M248 2v36 M254 9v22 M260 14v12 M266 8v24 M272 3v34 M278 12v16 M284 16v8 M290 11v18 M296 5v30 M302 9v22 M308 13v14 M314 6v28 M320 3v34 M326 11v18 M332 15v10 M338 10v20 M344 6v28 M350 12v16 M356 4v32 M362 8v24 M368 14v12 M374 10v20 M380 5v30 M386 11v18 M392 15v10 M398 10v20 M404 15v10 M410 17v6 M416 18v4\" stroke=\"url(#deck-wave)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></path></svg>\n<span class=\"absolute left-[31%] h-10 w-px bg-[#e9d8a6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"playhead position marker\"></span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-[12px] tabular-nums text-[#8f887c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-4-3\" data-name=\"total time display\">4:32</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#82745e]/25 pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5\" data-name=\"volume and queue controls group\"><span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#c9c1b1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-1\" data-name=\"volume icon wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-volume-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-1-1\" data-name=\"volume icon\"></i></span><input aria-label=\"Volume\" class=\"h-1 w-[82px] accent-[#d7c69c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-2\" data-name=\"volume slider\" max=\"100\" min=\"0\" type=\"range\" value=\"65\"/><button aria-label=\"Music queue\" class=\"yt-control ml-1 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-[19px] text-[#c9c1b1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3\" data-name=\"music queue button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-list-music\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3-1\" data-name=\"list music icon\"></i></button></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>",
