the stairwell</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-[14px] text-[#dfdcd1]\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"short category and duration text\">Architecture · 0:28</span></span>\n</button>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[18px] text-[#aaa89f]\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"short preview credit text\">Preview photo: Andrea G / Unsplash</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"w-[224px] shrink-0 snap-start\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2\" data-name=\"short video card\">\n<button aria-label=\"Play short: Metal in blue\" class=\"glass relative block aspect-[9/16] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-left\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"short video play button\" type=\"button\">\n<img alt=\"Brushed metal folds reflecting cyan light. Photograph by Andrei Castanha on Unsplash.\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"short video preview image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1704158853042-105006b01cf0?auto=format&amp;w=480&amp;q=85&amp;fit=crop\"/>\n<span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#040407]/95 via-transparent to-transparent\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"short video bottom gradient scrim\"></span><span class=\"player-glass absolute right-3 top-3 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"play button overlay\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-play\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"play triangle icon\"></i></span><span class=\"absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"short video label overlay\"><span class=\"block text-[18px] font-medium leading-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"short title text\">Metal in blue</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-[14px] text-[#dfdcd1]\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"short category and duration text\">Material study · 0:19</span></span>\n</button>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[18px] text-[#aaa89f]\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"short preview credit text\">Preview photo: Andrei Castanha / Unsplash</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"mx-4 mt-9 border-t border-[#706c63]/35 pb-5 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-6-6\" data-name=\"content footer\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#c8c2ae]\" data-kid=\"1-6-6-1\" data-name=\"footer brand and credits text\"><span class=\"display text-[19px] text-[#f5f3ea]\" data-kid=\"1-6-6-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name text\">YT Media</span> • Powered by <span class=\"text-[#d4af37]\" data-kid=\"1-6-6-1-2\" data-name=\"footer agency name text\">Vorex Agency</span> | Built by Dhiraj Kondalwar</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#93938f]\" data-kid=\"1-6-6-2\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer text\">Collection preview. Photo credits accompany each image.</p>\n</footer>\n</main>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-20 bg-linear-to-t from-[#040407] via-[#040407]/80 to-transparent px-3 pb-3 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"bottom sticky player and nav container\">\n<section aria-label=\"Music player preview: Blue hour\" class=\"player-glass pointer-events-auto mx-1 mb-3 flex h-[68px] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full pl-2.5 pr-2\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"music player card\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"vinyl relative flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#7e7e82]/40\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"spinning vinyl record art\"><img alt=\"Blue hour album artwork. Photograph by Andrei Castanha on Unsplash.\" class=\"h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"vinyl album thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1704158853042-105006b01cf0?auto=format&amp;w=100&amp;q=75&amp;fit=crop\"/><span class=\"absolute h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-[#edeadf]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"vinyl center hole dot\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"player track info block\"><p class=\"text-[16px] font-medium leading-5\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"now playing title text\">Blue hour</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-4 text-[#c0beb7]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"now playing progress and duration text\" data-reason=\"elapsed time text updated by player script as audio plays\">Ambient · 1:18 / 4:36</p></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Pause Blue hour\" class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#06b6d4] text-[21px] text-[#031419] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_#ffffff60] active:scale-95\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"player pause button\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-pause\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"pause icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Next music track\" class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[20px] active:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4\" data-name=\"next track button\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-skip-forward\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1\" data-name=\"skip forward icon\"></i></button>\n</section>\n<nav aria-label=\"Media sections\" class=\"player-glass pointer-events-auto grid h-[72px] grid-cols-5 items-center gap-1 rounded-[22px] px-2\" data-kid=\"1-7-2\" data-name=\"bottom media section navigation\">\n<button aria-current=\"page\" class=\"flex h-14 min-w-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-white/9 text-[13px] leading-4\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"home tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"home icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-house\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"house icon\"></i></span>Home</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-14 min-w-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl text-[13px] leading-4 text-[#d0cec5] active:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"videos tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"clapperboard icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-clapperboard\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"clapperboard icon\"></i></span>Videos</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-14 min-w-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl text-[13px] leading-4 text-[#d0cec5] active:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3\" data-name=\"shorts tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-1\" data-name=\"smartphone icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-smartphone\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"smartphone icon\"></i></span>Shorts</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-14 min-w-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl text-[13px] leading-4 text-[#d0cec5] active:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-4\" data-name=\"post tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-4-1\" data-name=\"image icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-image\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"image icon\"></i></span>Post</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-14 min-w-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl text-[13px] leading-4 text-[#d0cec5] active:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-5\" data-name=\"music tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-5-1\" data-name=\"record disc icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-disc-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"record disc icon\"></i></span>Music</button>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>",
