"now playing track title\">Night currents</h2><p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-[#c8c3b8]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"player time row with equalizer\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-3 items-end gap-[2px] text-[#d4af37]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"animated equalizer bars\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-0.5 bg-current\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"equalizer bar one\"></span><span class=\"h-3 w-0.5 bg-current\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"equalizer bar two\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-0.5 bg-current\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"equalizer bar three\"></span></span>1:08 / 4:32</p></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Pause Night currents\" class=\"flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[23px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"pause track button\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-pause\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"pause icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Next track\" class=\"flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4\" data-name=\"next track button\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-skip-forward\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-4-1\" data-name=\"skip forward icon\"></i></button>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-12 right-12 h-px bg-[#f5f3ea]/15\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-5\" data-name=\"progress track background\"><div class=\"h-px w-1/4 bg-[#d4af37]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-5-1\" data-name=\"progress bar filled portion\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<nav aria-label=\"Media formats\" class=\"yt-glass grid h-[68px] grid-cols-5 items-center rounded-[22px] px-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"bottom tab navigation\">\n<button aria-current=\"page\" class=\"flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl text-[#e0bf55]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"home tab button (active)\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"home icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-house\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"home house icon\"></i></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"home tab label\">Home</span></button>\n<button class=\"flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl text-[#d8d5cf]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"videos tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"clapperboard videos icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-clapperboard\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"clapperboard icon\"></i></span><span class=\"text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"videos tab label\">Videos</span></button>\n<button class=\"flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl text-[#d8d5cf]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"shorts tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"shorts gallery icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-gallery-vertical-end\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shorts gallery icon\"></i></span><span class=\"text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"shorts tab label\">Shorts</span></button>\n<button class=\"flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl text-[#d8d5cf]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"post tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"post panel icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-panels-top-left\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"panel icon\"></i></span><span class=\"text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"post tab label\">Post</span></button>\n<button class=\"flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl text-[#d8d5cf]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-5\" data-name=\"music tab button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-[21px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-5-1\" data-name=\"music icon wrapper\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-music-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"music note icon\"></i></span><span class=\"text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-5-2\" data-name=\"music tab label\">Music</span></button>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>",
